{"nodes": [{"id": "app_templates_videos_detail", "label": "Video Detail Template", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "app/templates/videos/detail.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "app_templates_videos_detail_publish_readiness", "label": "Publishing Readiness Gate", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "app/templates/videos/detail.html", "source_location": "lines 33-50, 126-152", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One call to video.blocking_reasons() drives both the banner ('Not publishable yet' with the reason list) and the Publish card, which refuses to render the queue form while any problem stands. Single source of truth for publishability - commented as 'the single most useful thing on this page' - so the UI can never offer an upload the server would reject."}, {"id": "app_templates_videos_detail_rights_attestation", "label": "Attributed Rights Confirmation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "app/templates/videos/detail.html", "source_location": "lines 44-49, 109-119", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rights confirmation is a named human attestation, not a flag: rights_confirmed_by and rights_confirmed_at are displayed on the ready banner and the form warns 'your name is recorded in the audit log against this confirmation'. Makes the copyright decision personally accountable, and requires PUBLISH_VIDEOS rather than mere MANAGE_VIDEOS."}], "edges": [{"source": "app_web_videos_detail", "target": "app_templates_videos_detail", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "app/templates/videos/detail.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "app_templates_videos_detail", "target": "app_web_videos_edit", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file